    "problem_statement": "#### Description\n\nThe `@typechecked` decorator fails with `NameError: name 'module_code' is not defined` when applied to functions.\n\n#### Steps/Code to Reproduce\n\n```python\nfrom typeguard import typechecked\n\n@typechecked\ndef simple_function(x: int) -> int:\n    return x + 1\n\nsimple_function(5)\n```\n\nThis raises:\n```\nNameError: name 'module_code' is not defined\n```\n\nThe same error occurs with various function types including generators, async functions, methods, and class methods. The decorator appears to be referencing an undefined variable during the instrumentation process."
  }
